# LANTERN GAME OVER
# THIS COPY HAS A LEAD MELODY ON CHANNEL 1, WRITTEN BY CLAUDE AS AN EXAMPLE of what could go
# there. It is not Greg's writing. The accompaniment is the same as in songs/lantern/.
# Game over: slow held 16-bit piano chords falling in A minor, no drums. Plays once.
# LANTERN, a ballad suite for one game: TITLE, VILLAGE, JOURNEY, MEMORY, NIGHT, VICTORY,
# GAME OVER and CREDITS. All in C major or its relative A minor, piano-led, on one set of
# instruments. The title is New song's Ballad style with its defaults.
#
# A starting point made by PokeyTracker's New song window, by rule: each section's beat, bass
# and accompaniment worked out from the key, the chords and the band chosen. The tune is yours.
# Chords: i VII VI v:  Am G F Em.
# The format is in Demo1/CLAUDE.md, under "Song files".

song   LANTERN GAME OVER
key    A MINOR

# A plain square wave, for a tune.
instrument LEAD
  table      tone
  volume     12 11 10 10 9
  distortion tone
  release    2

# Distortion C, for a bass. Its table skips notes - see which in the tracker's colours.
instrument BASS
  table      buzz
  volume     12 11 10 9 8
  distortion buzz
  release    3

# A piano: struck, falling away, and holding softly - 16-bit, so every note is within two cents.
instrument PIANO
  table      wide
  volume     13 12 11 10 10 9 9 8 8 7 7 6 6 5 5 5 4 4 4 3
  distortion tone
  release    3

channel 1 notes LEAD
  note  An example lead melody, written by Claude - not Greg's. The tracks are named M + the section's chord track.
  voice LEAD
  track MINTRO E5 . . .  . . . .  D5 . . .  C5 . . .
  track MINTRO2 B4 . . .  . . . .  B4 . . .  G4 . . .
  track MEND    A4 . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . - .

channel 2 notes BASS
  note  Bass: roots, on the chords' roots.
  voice BASS
  track INTRO A1 . . .  . . . .  A1 . . .  . . . .
  track INTRO2 G2 . . .  . . . .  E2 . . .  . . . .
  track END    A1 . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .

channel 3 pair LOW BYTE
  note  The low byte of channel 4's 16-bit divider.

channel 4 notes PATTERN
  note  Held chord, on each chord.
  voice PIANO
  track INTRO Am . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track INTRO2 G . . .  . . . .  Em . . .  . . . .
  track END    Am . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .

# The order list: a section at a time.
audctl $28
speed  12
section INTRO
line   MINTRO  INTRO  .  INTRO
line   MINTRO2  INTRO2  .  INTRO2
section END
line   MEND  END  .  END
end
